OL,3,GNEWSAMan sought over wrong-way crash on
OL,4,AM1 northbound
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have released an image of a man
OL,7,Fwanted on suspicion of causing serious
OL,8,Finjury by dangerous driving and theft
OL,9,Fof a motor vehicle.
OL,11,FDavid Nutall, who is 38 and from
OL,12,FRotherham, is believed to have driven a
OL,13,Fblue Kia Proceed the wrong way on the
OL,14,Fnorthbound carriageway of the M1 near
OL,15,Fjunction 41 shortly after 23:00 BST on
OL,16,F11 September.
OL,18,FThe car crashed with a red Dacia
OL,19,FSandero, leaving a man in his 20s in
OL,20,Fhospital with serious and potentially
OL,21,Flife-changing injuries, West Yorkshire
OL,22,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
