OL,3,GNEWSAMan sought over wrong-way crash on
OL,4,AM1 northbound
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man, 15-year-old girl
OL,7,Fand a woman aged 30 were arrested at
OL,8,Fthe scene and have since been bailed
OL,9,Fpending further inquiries, the force
OL,10,Fadded.
